{"completed": true, "response": "<WritingBlock id=\"58321\" variant=\"standard\">摇荡渐渐安稳下来，音乐仿佛找到了一种柔软而自然的呼吸。旋律轻轻起伏，像两道声音轮流倾诉，又像同一缕歌声悄然分开，彼此贴近、缠绕、应和。那份温存并不只是宁静，声音里有一种微微发热的甜美，带着触手可及的亲密和难以掩饰的愉悦。每一次婉转都似乎舍不得离开，又被下一次起伏温柔地牵引向前。乐句越唱越绵长，柔情中渐渐生出一点急切，仿佛眼前的美好越是令人沉醉，便越难使人满足。临近末尾，声音慢慢聚拢，情绪也随之变得浓密，几乎要将这份亲密握紧，却又在最后轻轻松开。余下的不是平静，而是一种仍在微微荡漾的渴望。</", "metadata": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "headless": true, "provider_interface": true, "no_auto_retry": true, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\yi-cookie-repair-20261006\\job-25c828ced9a048edb1266df9b2ec4f04", "response_sha256": "787fa0f3e5879e9987a906c34168c755d7abf4ab69eb9156285e1e4a64a937d2", "session_handle": "96956da7-272e-43af-8388-f8a6429e555a", "attachments": [], "prompt_normalization": "single_leading_BOM_removed_CRLF_or_CR_to_LF_and_trim_end", "pre_submit_scope": null, "initialization": {"source": "native_pre_send_aborted_handoff", "browser_assisted_initialization": true, "native_browser_generation_sent": false, "http_version": "auto", "nonpersonalization_inherited": false, "handoff_age_seconds": 0.886, "state": "claimed"}, "headless_initializer": {"headless": true, "native_browser_generation_sent": false, "completed": true, "browser_version": {"type": "string", "length": 13, "sha256": "9722c94be680575b307b26183e1a423460d4568949ad7f3e7f985d33d9bf0e26"}, "sealed_handoff_written": true, "browser_closed": true, "cloned_private_profile_removed": true, "elapsed_seconds": 7.101}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "continuation_expected": false, "handoff_seen": false, "lifecycle_updates": 201, "first_assistant_seconds": 16.219, "first_text_seconds": 18.375, "stream_seconds": 28.891, "channel_update_counts": {"final": 192}, "bounded_server_observations": {"scope": "http_sse", "tool_message_observation_count": 0, "truncated": false, "scalar_patch_tool_role_inheritance": false, "message_finished_successfully_is_tool_success": false, "tool_result_observatio